@@ -0,0 +1,62 @@
+To migrate Syrabit.ai's AHSEC/SEBA RAG vectors from MongoDB Atlas to Pinecone (syrabit-ahsec index), leverage Pinecone's $1k credits for sub-50ms p99 recall—5–10x faster than Atlas—while keeping MongoDB for metadata/chapters. [perplexity](https://www.perplexity.ai/search/9dea9b1b-ca18-4be0-a8df-2ca377a34264)
+
+## Setup & Secrets
+Add `PINECONE_KEY`/`PINECONE_INDEX=syrabit-ahsec` env vars (Railway). Implement `ensure_pinecone_index()` mirroring `ensure_vector_index()`: Serverless AWS us-east-1, 1024-dim (Cohere multilingual-v3.0), cosine metric. [docs](https://docs.rs/crate/pinecone-sdk/latest)
+
+```python
+# In config.py or utils.py
+from pinecone import Pinecone
+def ensure_pinecone_index():
+    pc = Pinecone(api_key=os.getenv('PINECONE_KEY'))
+    if 'syrabit-ahsec' not in pc.list_indexes().names():
+        pc.create_index(
+            name='syrabit-ahsec',
+            dimension=1024,
+            metric='cosine',
+            spec=ServerlessSpec(cloud='aws', region='us-east-1')
+        )
+```
+
+## PineconeVectorRetriever
+Create `retrievers/pinecone_vector.py`: Matches `MongoVectorRetriever` interface (query/upsert/delete).
+- ID: `chunk_id`; metadata: `{'subject_id', 'chapter_id', 'board_id', 'embedding_model'}`.
+- Filters: `pc_index.query(vector=emb, top_k=k, filter={'board_id': 'ahsec'})`. [docs.pinecone](https://docs.pinecone.io/integrations/langchain)
+
+```python
+class PineconeVectorRetriever:
+    def __init__(self):
+        self.pc = Pinecone(api_key=os.getenv('PINECONE_KEY'))
+        self.index = self.pc.Index('syrabit-ahsec')
+    
+    def query(self, embedding, top_k=5, filter=None):
+        res = self.index.query(vector=embedding, top_k=top_k, include_metadata=True, filter=filter)
+        return [{'chunk_id': m['id'], 'vs_score': match.score} for match in res.matches]
+    
+    def upsert(self, vectors):  # [{'id': chunk_id, 'values': emb, 'metadata': {...}}]
+        self.index.upsert(vectors=vectors, batch_size=100)
+```
+
+## Migration Script
+`scripts/migrate_chunks_to_pinecone.py`: Batch read MongoDB `chunks` (non-null `embedding`), upsert to Pinecone. Dry-run flag, progress logging. [estuary](https://estuary.dev/blog/mongodb-to-pinecone/)
+
+```python
+# Pseudo: mongo_client.db.chunks.find({'embedding': {'$ne': None}}).batch_size(100)
+# For each batch: [{'id': doc['chunk_id'], 'values': doc['embedding'], 'metadata': {...}}]
+retriever = PineconeVectorRetriever()
+if dry_run: print(f"Would upsert {len(batch)}")
+else: retriever.upsert(batch)
+```
+
+## Code Swaps
+**rag.py (_fetch_chunks_semantic ~473-549):** Replace `$vectorSearch` with `PineconeVectorRetriever().query(emb, filter={'board_id': board_id})` → extract `chapter_ids` → MongoDB full fetch. [docs.pinecone](https://docs.pinecone.io/integrations/langchain)
+
+**chunk_embedder.py:** Post-embed: `upsert` to Pinecone if `PINECONE_WRITE=true`; dual-write transition.
+
+**subject_router.py:** Evaluate—if same `chunks` index → Pinecone; else document Atlas retention. [perplexity](https://www.perplexity.ai/search/9dea9b1b-ca18-4be0-a8df-2ca377a34264)
+
+## Validation & Cutover
+- Migrate prod `chunks`.
+- Shadow: Parallel queries (5+ AHSEC/SEBA Qs), compare top-k IDs/scores.
+- Flip `PINECONE_WRITE=true`; archive Atlas vectors. [geeksforgeeks](https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/mongodb/mongodb-vector-search-vs-pinecone/)
+
+This unlocks Pinecone speed (~4ms p50 vs. Mongo 20ms+) with zero-downtime; $1k credits cover 100k DAU year+. Hybrid: Pinecone vectors + MongoDB keyword/metadata → reranker intact. [alphacorp](https://alphacorp.ai/blog/best-vector-databases-for-rag-2026-top-7-picks)
